&lt;li&gt;Innovate and optimize revenue and cost structures to grow the business, ensuring high-quality delivery across sponsorships, custom events, and media buy partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Brand Partnership proposals from a strategic perspective, structuring compelling, insight-driven cases and strategies for sponsorships, custom event activations, and media buys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and implement new growth strategies to drive impact across Brand Partnerships, establishing key business metrics, identifying performance gaps, and optimizing operations to meet and excel above business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and manage scalable business strategies and processes that accelerate partnership growth and improve operational efficiency across the organisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work across diverse markets, partners, and internal teams, establishing and executing successful growth strategies in a complex, fast-moving global environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You hold a degree in Engineering, Mathematics, Statistics, or Data Analytics (STEM degree).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years of experience in analytical and business strategy roles, demonstrating ownership, high levels of accountability, attention to detail, and a proactive, self-motivated approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are passionate about using data to drive strategic decisions, with strong analytical and quantitative skills and a data-driven mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a natural self-learner, able to explore relevant new technologies, understand them, and find optimal implementations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your exceptional written and verbal communication skills allow you to excel in cross-functional collaboration and convey complex concepts to diverse audiences including senior clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in both written and spoken English is a must; knowledge of additional languages such as Spanish is a valuable asset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are a proactive problem-solver who actively seeks opportunities for improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in brand partnerships, sponsorships, or commercial strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Python, JavaScript, SQL, or other programming languages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the state of the art in AI and automation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits &amp;amp; Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attractive compensation package with room to grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;40% discount on all Fever events and experiences + free Candlelight voucher.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous Parental Leave: We go well beyond the UK statutory minimum with 16 weeks of fully paid leave for birthing parents and 8 weeks for non-birthing parents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Future-Proof Pension: We invest in your future with Nest. Fever contributes a generous 10% of your gross salary, with a 4% contribution from you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private health and dental insurance with Bupa: 100% covered by Fever.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CycleSaver &amp;amp; Nursery Support: Save on your commute and childcare through tax-free salary sacrifice schemes for bikes, gear, and nursery costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellhub membership for gym and wellness access: paid by Fever up to the bronze plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Language learning support: English and Spanish lessons.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dynamic international team: a young, talented group creating a great work environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thank you for considering joining Fever. We cannot wait to learn more about you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to learn more about us: &lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-US/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://newsroom.feverup.com/en-UKI/208389-goldman-sachs-asset-management-leads-227m-investment-in-live-entertainment-tech-startup-fever&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Fever&#39;s Blog&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://tech.eu/2023/02/02/fever-raises-110-million-in-new-round-at-1-8-billion-valuation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Tech.Eu&lt;/a&gt; |&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://techcrunch.com/2019/08/04/data-driven-events-discovery-and-planning-startup-fever-raises-35-million-led-by-rakuten/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot; data-remove-tab-index=&quot;true&quot;&gt;TechCrunch&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fever is committed to creating an inclusive and diverse workspace where everyone&#39;s background and ideas count. Our main goal is to find the best possible talent regardless of place of birth, racial or ethnic origin, gender, gender identity, religion, opinion, sexual orientation, disability, pregnancy, marital status, age or caring responsibilities. We encourage everyone to apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require any kind of accommodation during the selection process please contact our Talent team so we can help you by providing a welcoming and seamless journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want to know more about how Fever processes your personal data, click here&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/1cIzPP7QJGht5LAGKkRGQP8fxh-Z4Mfph2JhGSvhd8zM/edit?tab=t.0#heading=h.y7rpsj7nzave&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Fever - Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

